## The Common Writ

wg-law-chapter-reality = Article I: Crimes against Reality
wg-law-chapter-persons = Article II: Crimes against persons and vessels
wg-law-chapter-bench = Article III: Crimes against the Bench
wg-law-chapter-central = Article IV: Ordinances of Caelestinus Central

wg-law-anchor-breach = Breach of the Anchors
wg-law-anchor-breach-text = Raising a hand, weapon or tool against an anchor, its shield or its wardens, or cutting the power to a sanctioned relay.
wg-law-trespass = Trespass beyond the Anchors
wg-law-trespass-text = Entering Dissonance or Feedback space without a Coda Writ.
wg-law-deep-trespass = Trespass in the Coda
wg-law-deep-trespass-text = Entering the Coda without a Bench-sanctioned expedition.
wg-law-unsanctioned-landing = Unsanctioned Landing
wg-law-unsanctioned-landing-text = Entering orbit around, or landing on, a world the Bench has not sanctioned.
wg-law-quarantine-breach = Quarantine Breach
wg-law-quarantine-breach-text = Landing on a quarantine world, or carrying anything off one.
wg-law-unlawful-possession = Possession of Unlawful Material
wg-law-unlawful-possession-text = Holding unlawful material for personal use: a shard, a charm, a token.
wg-law-unlawful-trafficking = Trafficking in Unlawful Material
wg-law-unlawful-trafficking-text = Mining, refining, selling, carrying in bulk or fitting unlawful material to a vessel.
wg-law-artifact = Harbouring an Artifact
wg-law-artifact-text = Keeping, powering or wiring into a vessel any unregistered object recovered beyond the anchors.
wg-law-sedition = Sedition against the Anchors
wg-law-sedition-text = Preaching the unmooring of the sector, or belonging to any congregation that does.

wg-law-murder = Murder
wg-law-murder-text = Unlawfully killing a person.
wg-law-assault = Assault
wg-law-assault-text = Unlawfully harming a person.
wg-law-piracy = Piracy
wg-law-piracy-text = Harpooning, pinning, boarding or stripping a vessel without its crew's consent.
wg-law-hull-theft = Hull Theft
wg-law-hull-theft-text = Flying, selling or breaking a vessel without its deed, or dealing in its parts.
wg-law-narcotics-possession = Narcotics Possession
wg-law-narcotics-possession-text = Holding a controlled narcotic or neuroware build for personal use.
wg-law-narcotics-trafficking = Narcotics Trafficking
wg-law-narcotics-trafficking-text = Growing, cooking, selling or carrying in bulk any controlled narcotic or neuroware build.
wg-law-unlawful-loading = Unlawful Loading
wg-law-unlawful-loading-text = Loading neuroware into a synthetic without its consent. Charged together with Assault where it harms them.

wg-law-heave-to = Failing to Heave To
wg-law-heave-to-text = Ignoring or fleeing a judge's hail.
wg-law-contempt = Contempt of the Bench
wg-law-contempt-text = Attacking or impersonating a judge, or escaping their custody.
wg-law-false-distress = False Distress
wg-law-false-distress-text = Sending a distress call where there is none.
wg-law-warheads = Unsanctioned Warheads
wg-law-warheads-text = Arming a warhead without the authority of a faction's command in time of declared war.

wg-law-brandishing = Brandishing
wg-law-brandishing-text = Carrying a weapon drawn, unholstered or unbagged aboard Central.
wg-law-discharge = Discharge
wg-law-discharge-text = Firing a weapon aboard Central.
wg-law-neutral-ground = Breach of Neutral Ground
wg-law-neutral-ground-text = Waging faction war aboard Central, or within its sanctuary.
wg-law-docking = Docking Order
wg-law-docking-text = Docking against the dockmaster's word, or keeping ship weapons hot within the sanctuary.
wg-law-undeclared = Undeclared Material
wg-law-undeclared-text = Failing to declare unlawful material on docking. Charged together with Article I.
wg-law-concealment = Concealment
wg-law-concealment-text = Refusing to show identification to a judge.

wg-penalty-citation = Citation
wg-penalty-impound = Impound
wg-penalty-banishment = Banishment
wg-penalty-outlawry = Outlawry

contraband-examine-text-WGUnlawful = [color=#b040e0]This is unlawful material under the Common Writ. Surrender it to the Bench.[/color]
